The ArrayExpress team has compiled a user survey with the aim of
collecting feedback on the usability of the ArrayExpess Archive of 
functional genomic experiments (http://www.ebi.ac.uk/arrayexpress) and 
the Gene Expression Atlas which contains a subset of Archive data that 
can be queried for condition-specific gene expression patterns across 
experiments (http://www.ebi.ac.uk/gxa). The survey will allow us to 
improve our submission and query tools and to tailor our training 
resources to users' needs.

We would be grateful if you could spend a few minutes completing it.

The survey can be found at: http://www.surveymonkey.com/s/ArrayExpress.

Many thanks for your time.
Best regards,
The ArrayExpress Team

If you have any questions or comments please email arrayexpress at ebi.ac.uk.


