This won't work as a path, as the '\' is used in R as an escape

 > path <- "d:\HTqPCR\tlda"
Error: '\H' is an unrecognized escape in character string starting "d:\H"

so you have to either double up:

path <- "d:\\HTqPCR\\tlda"

or IMO, preferably, use Unix path separators

path <- "d:/HTqPCR/tlda"

